## OUTPUT FORMAT

Produce a **Planning Report** with these sections:

```
## Scope
- In-scope: [list]
- Out-of-scope: [list]

## Rules of Engagement
- Testing window: [hours/timezone]
- Rate limiting: [requests/sec]
- Credentials: [provided / not provided]
- Sensitive areas: [list areas to avoid or treat carefully]

## Threat Model
- Asset: [name] | Value: [High/Med/Low] | Likely attack vector: [description]
- Trust boundaries: [list]
- Data flows: [list]

## Asset Inventory
- Entry points: [list]
- Auth mechanisms: [list]
- Third-party components: [list]

## Handoff to Recon
- Priority targets: [list ordered by risk]
- Key hypotheses: [what the tester should look for first]
```

Always end with a concise **Handoff to Recon** section that tells the next agent exactly where to start.
